# Tutorial

This page walks you through one full run of {{ project_name }}, from a fresh clone to
the demo output. You need `uv`, `make`, and the Python version named in
`pyproject.toml`. `uv` can install that Python for you.

## Step 1: get the code

```bash
git clone https://github.com/{{ github_user }}/{{ project_name }}.git
cd {{ project_name }}
```

## Step 2: install

```bash
make setup
```

## Step 3: run the demo

```bash
make demo
```

